{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01540","headline":"琴曲歌辞 别鹤 · 王建","name":"琴曲歌辞 别鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主人一去池水绝，池鹤散飞不相别。\n青天漫漫碧海重，知向何山风雪中？\n万里虽然音影在，向心终是死生同。\n池边巢破松树死，树头年年乌生子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}